{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/pulls/2857","id":4176562267,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAKhmnM748Uhb","html_url":"https://github.com/su2code/SU2/pull/2857","diff_url":"https://github.com/su2code/SU2/pull/2857.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/su2code/SU2/pull/2857.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/issues/2857","number":2857,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix implicit target-time evaluation","user":{"login":"bigboateng","id":10779355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzc5MzU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10779355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng","html_url":"https://github.com/bigboateng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What changed\n\n- centralize projection from zero-based time-iteration labels to physical solver time\n- evaluate direct dual-time target states at `(TimeIter + 1) * deltaT`\n- use the projected time for grid and surface motion, gusts, solver globals, and history output\n- preserve zero-based output/restart labels and existing adjoint and harmonic-balance interpretations\n- add configuration and first-step rigid-motion regression coverage\n\n## Why\n\nIn implicit dual-time schemes, `TimeIter` is a zero-based artifact/restart label, while the state being solved represents the end of that physical step. Several consumers reconstructed physical time directly as `TimeIter * deltaT`, causing the first implicit state to use time zero for time-varying motion and forcing terms.\n\nThis separates artifact identity from target-state time without renumbering restart or output files.\n\nRelated to su2code/SU2#2353.\n\n## Validation\n\n- built `SU2_CFD/src/SU2_CFD`\n- built `UnitTests/test_driver`\n- passed `[CConfig][time]`: 2 test cases, 12 assertions\n- bounded dual-time integration case retained `Time_Iter = 0` and `flow_00000.vtk` while reporting `Cur_Time = 0.01`\n\nThe full SU2 regression matrix and complete adjoint regression suites were not run.\n","created_at":"2026-07-31T09:21:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T08:08:07Z","closed_at":"2026-09-05T08:07:57Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"5f36e3afe084e91abf9ae8a0724d620ba6bba0cb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/pulls/2857/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/pulls/2857/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/issues/2857/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/su2code/SU2/statuses/df00fb7b7a34e08765796fd3342ac825e690694f","head":{"label":"bigboateng:codex/issue-2353-time-semantics","ref":"codex/issue-2353-time-semantics","sha":"df00fb7b7a34e08765796fd3342ac825e690694f","user":{"login":"bigboateng","id":10779355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzc5MzU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10779355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng","html_url":"https://github.com/bigboateng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bigboateng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users